            description: Some("para-Cresol, also 4-methylphenol, is an organic compound with the formula CH3C6H4(OH).  It is a colourless solid that is widely used intermediate in the production of other chemicals. It is a derivative of phenol and is an isomer of o-cresol and m-cresol."),
            text_source: Some("Wikipedia"),
            hazard_summary: Some("H301: Toxic if swallowed [Danger Acute toxicity, oral]"),
            uses: ["Cleaning agent", "Fragrance", "Monomers", "Solvent"],
            logp: Some(1.701),
            appearance: Some("P-cresol is a colorless solid with a tar like odor. Sinks and mixes slowly with water. (USCG, 1999)"),
