            description: Some("Propionitrile, also known as ethyl cyanide and propanenitrile, is an organic compound with the formula CH3CH2CN.  It is a simple aliphatic nitrile.  The compound is a colourless, water-soluble liquid.  It is used as a solvent and a precursor to other organic compounds."),
