            logp: Some(3.143),
            appearance: Some("1-octene appears as a colorless liquid. Flash point 70 °F. Insoluble in water and less dense (at about 6 lb / gal) than water. Hence floats on water. Vapors are heavier than air and may settle in depressions. Reported to biodegrade very slowly. Used in organic synthesis, surfactants, and plasticizers."),
            synonyms: ["octene", "1-C8H16", "octylene", "caprylene", "oct-1-ene", "1-n-octene", "n-1-octene", "1-caprylene"],
