            logp: Some(1.556),
            appearance: Some("Trichloroacetaldehyde appears as a colorless oily liquid with a penetrating odor. Reacts with water and denser than water. Contact may irritate skin, eyes and mucous membranes. Toxic by ingestion and inhalation. Used to make pesticides."),
            synonyms: ["Noctec", "Somnote", "Chloralhydrat", "knockout drops", "Chloral hydrate", "chloral monohydrate", "Aquachloral Supprettes", "Tri-Chloro-Acetaldehyde"],
