            properties: [IsMetal],
            description: Some("Magnesium bromide is a chemical compound of magnesium and bromine. It is often used as a mild sedative and as an anticonvulsant for treatment of nervous disorders. Bromine is a halogen element with the symbol Br and atomic number 35. Diatomic bromine does not occur naturally, but bromine salts can be found in crustal rock. (L625, L657)"),
